 # Toolkit
 
 Small utilities for things you do every day.
 
+## Cache
+
+Pass `ttl` in milliseconds to expire entries automatically on read.
+Use `onEvict` to clean up resources when an entry is removed.
+The default cache holds 100 entries with no expiration.
+
 See the API reference for examples.
